[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4980.229, "timestamp": "01:23:00", "text": "游戏。我很期待有一天能上场比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4984.03, "timestamp": "01:23:04", "text": "不过，《机械战警》倒是挺不错的。我喜欢看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4988.03, "timestamp": "01:23:08", "text": "电影。机械战警似乎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4999.709, "timestamp": "01:23:19", "text": "乐趣。是的，看起来确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5007.47, "timestamp": "01:23:27", "text": "墨菲。是的，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5010.47, "timestamp": "01:23:30", "text": "完成的。哦，等等。准备好？哦，不是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5013.11, "timestamp": "01:23:33", "text": "这个游戏讲的是……你知道的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5016.07, "timestamp": "01:23:36", "text": "那是一次袭击之类的，呃，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5019.91, "timestamp": "01:23:39", "text": "那些呃，警察，呃，不是警察"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5022.47, "timestamp": "01:23:42", "text": "人们喜欢警察之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5025.75, "timestamp": "01:23:45", "text": "那些联邦调查局之类的，他们负责联邦调查局的工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5028.87, "timestamp": "01:23:48", "text": "就是那种打开的东西，对吧？他们喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5031.95, "timestamp": "01:23:51", "text": "搬进去，坐下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5035.03, "timestamp": "01:23:55", "text": "pe，他们称之为“是的”。东西很干净"}]